member_chain_hug_calls.description:
A chain with at most this many calls keeps the last call's arguments on the line of the chain when they break (`Foo.Bar(
 args
)`); a chain with more calls that does not fit on a line is broken at its dots (`grouped` style; 0: the chain's groups decide, as in Prettier).

